  "description": "A comprehensive collection of utility methods for .NET Core/.NET 8 applications, providing robust solutions for common development tasks.\n\nThis library includes:\n- String manipulation utilities (case conversion, formatting, validation)\n- File & directory operations with retry mechanisms\n- JSON serialization helpers\n- Password generation and validation tools\n- Build configuration detection\n- Result pattern implementation for cleaner error handling\n\nThe utilities are designed to be lightweight, well-documented, and thoroughly tested to help you build more reliable applications with less code.\n\nCompatible with .NET 8 and above.",
